          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "UP Chief Minister Yogi Adityanath Pledges to Make Uttar Pradesh India's Deep Tech Capital",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "On National Technology Day, Uttar Pradesh Chief Minister Yogi Adityanath committed to transforming UP into India's Deep Tech Capital, citing the state's rapid emergence as a hub for IT parks, manufacturing, and startups. The announcement reflects a concerted state-level push to attract AI and semiconductor investment to India's most populous state, which is already home to the HCL-Foxconn semiconductor joint venture in Jewar. The declaration adds political weight to UP's ambition to rival Bengaluru and Hyderabad as a technology destination.",
            "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/sci-tech/technology/national-technology-day-committed-to-making-up-indias-deep-tech-capital-says-yogi-adityanath/article70964440.ece",
